  - The ghost launches fireballs that curve toward Natsuki.
  - The ghost throws out fireballs along with bolts of lightning.
  - The ghost rains down snow upon the group.
  - The ghost flings snow from the sides.
  - The ghost carefully aims lightning strikes at Natsuki.
